      "content": "idk, it just feels like the machine is winning. every single day i'm just trading my time and my soul for enough money to keep existing so i can go back to work the next day. there's no actual \"me\" left. if i just stopped... if i just wasn't part of it anymore... would it even matter? would anything even change?",
